Deep-sky catalogue data: dso.csv and names.csv
==============================================

dso.csv is generated by scripts/build_catalog.py from the sources below.
names.csv is hand-maintained and is an input to that build.


OpenNGC
-------

This catalogue contains data from OpenNGC, by Mattia Verga and contributors
(Patrick Chevalley, Christian Dersch, Jean-Sebastien Dieu, Sebastian Godelet).

